;; Real Shadow 3.4.10 fixture for ADVANCED-BROWSER digest elision
;; (rf2-vxgfnd.195 arm 4).
;;
;; The pre-existing residue scan lived inline in scripts/run-ui-bench.cjs over
;; `out/ui-bench.js` — a `:node-script` target. Browser-specific retention could
;; therefore remain unobserved, and the scanned source consumed no part of the
;; digest path, so its absence was unreachability rather than elision.
;;
;; These two builds are the SAME `:browser` entry
;; (`advanced-elision.consumer`, which roots the carrier slot, the sentinel, the
;; `bd1-` prefix test, the fail-loud configuration diagnostic, the live-root
;; registry traversal and the reload producers) at the SAME `:advanced`
;; optimization level. `goog.DEBUG` is the ONLY variable between them, which is
;; what makes the A/B causal rather than merely suggestive:
;;
;;   :ui-advanced-elision          goog.DEBUG false — THE production artifact.
;;                                 Residue must be ABSENT.
;;   :ui-advanced-elision-control  goog.DEBUG true  — the verifier's verifier.
;;                                 The same residue must be PRESENT, proving the
;;                                 grep fires on these exact byte sequences when
;;                                 the code really is there.
;;
;; NO build hook is configured, deliberately. A hook would PATCH the carrier's
;; fixed-width sentinel into a real `bd1-` digest before Closure ran, which
;; would make the sentinel grep pass for the wrong reason. Hookless keeps the
;; raw `__RF2_UI_DIGEST_XX__` literal in the compiled slot, so its absence from
;; the release is attributable to elision alone — and a hookless consumer build
;; is in any case the adversarial case production must survive.
;;
;; Kept independent of implementation/shadow-cljs.edn on purpose (the
;; digest_probe/{hookless,final_schedule} precedent): no build-id and no
;; :dev-http port is claimed in that hot-zone file, and no :build-defaults value
;; can be inherited or merged in.
{:source-paths ["../../../../../../core/src"
                "../../../../../src"
                "../../../.."]
 :cache-root "../../../../../../target/ui-advanced-elision/shadow-cache"
 :cache-blockers #{re-frame.ui}
 :js-options {:js-package-dirs ["../../../../../../node_modules"]}
 :builds
 {:ui-advanced-elision
  {:target :browser
   :output-dir "../../../../../../out/ui-advanced-elision"
   :asset-path "."
   :modules {:main {:entries [re-frame.ui.digest-probe.advanced-elision.consumer]
                    :init-fn re-frame.ui.digest-probe.advanced-elision.consumer/init}}}

  :ui-advanced-elision-control
  {:target :browser
   :output-dir "../../../../../../out/ui-advanced-elision-control"
   :asset-path "."
   :compiler-options {:closure-defines {goog.DEBUG true}}
   :modules {:main {:entries [re-frame.ui.digest-probe.advanced-elision.consumer]
                    :init-fn re-frame.ui.digest-probe.advanced-elision.consumer/init}}}}}
